  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EXO 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kufuma henohu aMosi naAroni epilili mudi Fwaro, amwilili nawu, Tiya chanahoshiyi Yehova, Nzambi yaIsarela, nindi, Yileki antu ami ayi akadyi chawija chami mwisaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fwaro welili nindi, Yehova hinyi mwaka nitiyi mwizu dindi, ninzi niyumbuku aIsarela? Ami hinamwiluka Yehovaku, niaIsarela hinakayumbaku kwamuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawu, Nzambi yawaHeberu tunadimoni nindi. Atuleki mwani, tuyi njila yakwenda mafuku asatu mwisapa, twakamuketwili Yehova Nzambi yetu yimuna, mukunkulwayiwakatuletela chipupu indi kwiji njita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta waEjipitu wayilili nindi, Enu aMosi naAroni, muloŋanyi munayifumishi antu kunyidimu yawu? Yenu mwakasendi yiteli yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fwaro nindi, Komana, antu amwituŋa anavuli dehi, ninenu himukuyinookesha kuyiteli yawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifuku dodenodu Fwaro walejeli tulala twawantu, nitupitawu twawu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Bayi muyinka cheŋi antu matahu akupika nachu matafwali neyichimwelaŋa dikaluku. Ayi akadikuŋwili awenawu matahu awu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka yesekelaŋa chi konkwanyi chamatafwali mwomwapi kilaŋawu chachikulu; bayi muchikeheshaku; komana akatala; dichi chakudililawu, nawu, Tulekenu tuyi twakamuketwili Nzambi yetu yimuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yivulishilenu amayala nyidimu yawu, kulonda akabakani nayu, kulonda abuli kutiyililamwaya mazu akutwamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tulala twawantu, nitupitawu twawu, edi kili hanzi, ahosheli nawantu, nawu, Tiyenu chanahoshiyi Fwaro, nindi, Hinukuyinka matahuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindi, Yenu enu aweni mwakakeŋakeŋi matahu enu kumunayiwani kwoku, ninyidimu yenu hiyakayi keheshaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nochu antu amwaŋeli mwahita ituŋa daEjipitu dejima nakukuŋula ntotu afwanishi neyi matahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atulala ayihindesheli, nawu, Manishenu nyidimu yenu mwomwese kayi konkwanyi yenu, neyi chimwelilaŋa himwadiŋi namatahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayeteli tuŋitawu twawanyana kaIsarela twashililuwu tulala twaFwaro kuyitala, ayihwili nawu, Indi yikonkwanyi yenu yakupika matafwali, nichahaloshi, nichalelu, munayi kaŋenyidi kuyimanisha neyi chimwelilaŋa hakusambila?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tupitawu twawanyana kaIsarela ayili nakudila kudi Fwaro, nawu, Muloŋanyi wunatwili chenichi etu ambuŋeyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etu ambuŋeyi hiyanatwinki matahuku, hiyakutwila nawu, Pikenu matafwali, ninetu ambuŋeyi anatweti; ilaŋa antu eyi diwu anatamishi, bayi etuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena welilinindi, Enu mwakatala, mwakatala, dichi chimwelaŋa nenu, Tuleki tuyitwakamuketwili Yehova yimuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yenu kwenu mwakakalakali; matahuhi yakayinkawuku, nichikonkwanyi chamatafwali chiŋa muchimanisha hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cheliluwu nawu, Bayi mukeheshaŋa matafwali enuku, chiŋa ifuku nichikonkwanyi chadu, ifuku nichikonkwanyi chadu, atupitawu twawanyana kaIsarela amweni hichinatami dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chafuminuwu mwaFwaro ayibulakeni aMosi naAroni, anemani munjila, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayilili nawu, Yehova ayitali, asompeshi, muloŋa munatununkishi dehi chatama nikudi Fwaro nikudiambuŋindi, munayishili mumakasawu mpoku yakabali yakutujaha nachu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mosi wafuntili cheŋi kudi Yehova, welili nindi, Eyi Mwanta, awa antuwunayi koŋelidi chatama? Wantemesheladi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saŋa nenjila kudi Fwarona kuhosha mwijina deyi, yena kwakuyikoŋa awa antu chatama hohu; helakuyipulwisha antu eyi hiwunayipulwishi nihantuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
